NPCs: {
	BigMimicBlooming.DisplayName: Blooming mimic

	Chat: {
		Guide: {
			DayTime: Very good day today!
			NightTime: Be careful at night!
			AEDWeapons: "{$Mods.WoS.General.GlobalTips.AEDItemsTip}"
		}
	}

	Bestiary.BigMimicBlooming: The mimics are overflowing with vitality, which makes them stronger. They became one with the force of nature. They can be birthed from ordinary chests by force.

	HunterTrader: {
		DisplayName: Hunter

		TownNPCMood: {
			Content: I'm fine, thanks.
			NoHome: I'm used to spending time outside, don't worry.
			FarFromHome: Ouch... Am I... lost?
			LoveSpace: More space around - more viewing angle! Practical.
			DislikeCrowded: I don't hear any animal sounds because of this noise of people...
			HateCrowded: There are too many people... Really. Are they rabbits?...
			LoveBiome: A {BiomeName}? That's good place for hunt!
			DislikeBiome: I really dont like hunt at {BiomeName}.
			LoveNPC: A {NPCName}? I think that she really cute!
			LikeNPC: I like {NPCName}.
			DislikeNPC: I don't like {NPCName}. He scares all animals around!
			LikeNPC_Princess: I recognize {NPCName} power, and I'm surprised at how easily she finds common ground even with birds...
			Princess_LovesNPC: A {NPCName}? This hunter? He's incredible at what he does!
		}

		Bestiary: {
			First: A cheerful and friendly hunter, always ready to share his knowledge and gear. For the right price, he can help you claim even the toughest prey.
			Second: Sells a variety of ammunition, hunting gear, and some of his hard-earned spoils.
		}

		Shop: {
			ShopBasic: Hunter's shop
			ShopAdditional: Ammunition's shop
		}

		Names: {
			Tourin: Tourin
			Thorne: Thorne
			Edward: Edward
			Yanokage: Yanokage
			Rowan: Rowan
			Eldric: Eldric
			Kazuki: Kazuki
			Steve: Steve
			Johnny: Johnny
			Peter: Peter
			Jack: Jack
			Hue: Hue
			Jullian: Jullian
			Gerald: Gerald
			Astel: Astel
			Kalpas: Kalpas
			Dante: Dante
			QrowBranwen: Qrow B.
			Hugo: Hugo
			Lycaon: Lycaon
			Yaoshi: Yaoshi
			Blade: Blade
			Lan: Lan
		}

		Chat: {
			AboutDungeon: "{$TownNPCMoodBiomes.Dungeon}?... The place where the old man used to roam? You'd better stay out of there. I tried to get in once, and....That look from the depths is still in my memory.."
			AboutHunt: Silence during hunting is one of the crucial factors for success. If you make any noise, the beast will notice you. Or a Monster, depending on who you're hunting..
			AboutBows: The main advantage of a bow is that it is quieter than a firearm. But learning how to shoot it is more difficult than it seems.
			AboutGuns: When it comes to monsters, there's no point worrying about "Ethics" and "hunter honor." If you have a gun, use it.
			AboutTraps: Traps are useful, but don't forget where you set them.
			AboutWeather: In rainy weather, animals prefer to sleep, and monsters prefer to act. Knowing the habits of different creatures makes hunting them easier.
			AboutFood: Before traveling anywhere, not just hunting, it is important to stock up on food properly. You don't want to run away from monsters hungry, do you?
			AboutLoot: Prey from animals is now valued worse than from monsters. And sometimes it even turns out that after hunting, there is no prey at all. But the world has become safer.
			AboutHunterHonor: Hunting is a competition when it comes to animals. There is no pleasure in secretly killing any animal. But if he has a chance to kill you, and you win in a difficult battle, it brings pleasure.
			AboutBeasts: Do not get carried away with the extermination of animals. If you get rid of some, you'll have problems with others... If you need to survive, take as much as you need, no more.
			AboutNight: At night, the most vile of all monsters awaken...
			WeatherRaining: Rain is a very pleasant time, especially if there are no monsters nearby. You can just sit at home and drink hot tea with lemon and honey...
			WeatherSlimes: It seems to me or... not... That's for sure... A rain of slimes?... What's happening?
			AboutSlimes: Slimes are the simplest of monsters. If you understand how they act in battle, then defeating them is only a matter of time.
			AboutZombies: Zombies? They look like people, or rather their corpses..But considering how many Zombies I sometimes see, I'd like to ask... But were they really people before?
			AboutEyes: Have you seen those creepy eyes in the sky? I wonder if they are related to that legend?...
			AboutEyeofCthulhu: Interestingly, they turned out to be associated with this very legend. What legend? Haven't you heard? They say that once upon a time one deity was divided into parts, and now his eyes, brain and even heart are scattered all over the world...
			AboutSkeletons: Skeletons don't have muscles, but they move...They don't have brains, but they don't act like zombies or slugs... I'm sorry, but I'm bad at magic, and I can't figure out how to neutralize them, excluding the option of shredding...
			AboutHornets: Are the hornets from the jungle giving you problems? Take a ranged weapon and keep a close eye on the surrounding field. Although their stingers fly fast, it is quite possible to dodge them.
			AboutBloodmoon: When the moon turns purple, the monsters become even more bloodthirsty... If you're not sure you can handle them, close the doors and seal them somehow.

			ArmsDealer: {
				AboutWeapons: "{0}? we have different choices in terms of weapons, but that doesn't stop us from communicating and getting along. After all, does it really matter which weapon you use to catch your prey?"
				AboutHunt: "{0} says I should use firearms more often for hunting... Well. It's a good solution for monsters, of course, but loud gunshots can scare animals, so I prefer to continue using a bow."
				AboutGuns: "{0} is very well versed in firearms. If I decide to go monster hunting again, I'll definitely run to him for more ammo or weapons."
				AboutNurse: Are {0} and {1} dating? Suddenly... Do you think they'll be okay?
				AboutAmmunition: Just as bows need arrows, so do firearms need bullets... I am glad that I can buy them from {0}. Oh, {0} should have sold arrows too..
				AboutDryad: "{0} once asked me how the {1} felt about the fact that he hunted various animals and monsters... Let's just say she's not too happy with some of his loot."
			}

			Zoolist: {
				AboutAnimals: Am I having problems with {0} because of my hunting? Do you think she'll mind? Don't worry, we've already discussed this, and she doesn't mind.
				AboutZoologist: I find {0} very cute. But I didn't tell you that. Besides, I can always contact her to find out something about the animals I'm going to hunt.
				AboutZoologistBrother: I know that {0} and {1} are siblings... But still, it's hard to believe. They look too different! And it's not about {0} 's ears and tail at all!
				AboutBloodmoon: It's better not to wonder where {0} disappears during the blood moon. If you try, you'll find out how arrows and bullets feel in all parts of the body.
				AboutSympathy: Do you think I have a chance with {0}? Learning to shoot arrows and firearms was easier than asking her out on a date...
				AboutForest: "{0} is incredibly well-versed in the forest! In this respect, we are similar to her. If you need help finding something, tell us, we will help!"
				AboutCurse: I know about the curse on {0}. She worries too much that her new appearance makes her look ugly.. But for me, she will be beautiful anyway, with or without ears.
				AboutTail: Of course, I'm used to strange things in my travels, but {0} tail and ears still amaze me. And... interest. Don't stare like that, it's none of your business!
				AboutTimeTogether: Sometimes {0} and I track rare creatures together. I take the bow, she takes her notebook and her enthusiasm. It's funny, isn't it? But it works.
				LearningNew: It's amazing how much {0} knows about animals. Sometimes I find myself listening to her stories, forgetting that I was going hunting. Maybe I can learn something from her?
			}

			Clothier: {
				AboutClothes: "{0} A master of his craft. Considering the past he told me about, it doesn't even come as a surprise.. After all, you have to have at least one hobby while being imprisoned alone.."
				AboutDungeon: What an amazing and terrifying story is connected with that dungeon... I hope {0} will have a peaceful and pleasant life now.
				AboutMaterials: I sometimes supply {0} different small bugs. It turns out that they are used to produce dyes! Isn't it amazing?
				AboutMonsters: After you removed the curse from {0}, I can now enter the depths of the dungeon. It's not like I expected to see any animals there... But learning how to shoot skeletons is a lot of fun!
				AboutBloodmoon: "{0} Calls this a problem? Ha! It's just an opportunity to earn some money and kill monsters! Stay at home if you're not sure you can handle it, and lock the doors, my advice to you."
				AboutPartyClothes: Outfits that {0} sells during the party... Very unusual.
			}

			Mechanic: {
				AboutDungeon: I'm really curious, how did it turn out that {0} was locked in a dungeon?..  No, I'm more interested in how she SURVIVED there.
				AboutFear: "{0} says she's not afraid of any monsters. And you try not to be afraid when a trap with a flamethrower or darts activates under your feet."
				AboutMedicalTroubles: The girl who fixes the wires? A dangerous girl. I saw her set up a trap right in the medical unit. Simply... just in case.
				AboutExplodedWorkshop: Did you know that {0} once blew up the entire underground workshop just to test a new timer? Says — 'everything went according to plan'
				AboutTraps: I like {0} inventions. Especially those that leave only dust from the monster... It's a pity that sometimes they work for their own people.
				AboutNoises: If you hear a click behind you, it's either a trap, or {0} 'improves' your home again.
				AboutTools: We argued with {0} about which was more effective—a shotgun or an electric trap. Spoiler alert: I don't have a gun anymore.
				AboutToolbox: Don't believe {0} innocent smile. There is at least one hidden mine in each of these toolboxes.
				AboutBombs: The mechanic is a genius, I do not argue. Just don't let her figure out anything about explosives. It was enough once.
				AboutGoblinTinkerer: At first I thought that {0} and {1} just work together.… And then I saw them arguing about the scheme of some kind of mechanism. Now I'm not sure if they're colleagues or if this is their way of flirting.
				AboutPrivateTime: I wonder if {0} and {1} really spend all their time fixing machinery? Or are they just pretending to be busy so that no one interferes with the two of them?
			}

			GoblinTinkerer: {
				AboutTraps: "{0} showed me some traps that he had constructed. Smart, practical, and... cruel. I even took one of them into the woods — it worked perfectly. I think we have a lot to learn from each other."
				AboutNoise: I don't know how he manages to make such loud noises with the help of small mechanisms... Seriously, I once thought that a goblin raid had started — and it was just {0} trying to fix the toaster.
				AboutFriendship: At first, I didn't trust {0}. After all, goblins and humans don't really get along. But now... He proves that even a former enemy can become an ally. Sometimes even a useful ally.
				AboutInventions: One day I asked {0} to make me an automatic crossbow. He did it. Crossbow accidently shot me in the leg. I'm not asking him for anything else.
				AboutGadgets: Have you seen what kind of things {0} makes? He gave me a trap once... It worked so well that the monster didn't even have time to make a sound. It's a pity that she exploded right after that.
				AboutRepair: "{0} can fix almost anything, from a broken firearm to an old bow. Sometimes it seems to me that he understands mechanisms better than people.… Maybe it is, though."
				AboutTracking: I asked {0} if there was any way to track the animals from a distance. He gave me something... It's weird. Now this 'sensor' emits an alarming beep every time I approach my cat.
			}

			Demolitionist: {
				AboutBlastFishing: .. I don't think this is normal. {0} explosions can stun fish a mile away! It's too much!
				AboutNoises: Every time I'm about to shoot an arrow at an unsuspecting beast... The noise of explosions can be heard and scares all the animals around!
				AboutBombs: Bombs? Grenades? No. I won't be able to use them for hunting. To begin with, there will be absolutely nothing left of the loot from the explosion!
				AboutExplosions: I'm not arguing, explosions look epic and beautiful sometimes. But that doesn't mean that someone needs to do them every 5 minutes!
				AboutAngler: This poor boy {1} couldn't sleep all night yesterday because of the explosions {0}! Do you have any idea how hard it was for me to help this kid finally fall asleep??
				AboutNight: Why do I live so close to a maniac who doesn't know what silence is?! I hate living next to {0}
			}

			Angler: {
				AboutAngler: I know {0} only for a week and half, but if anything happened to him, i would shoot everyone in this room and then myself.
				AboutFish: I do not know why {0} likes fish and cucumbers so much, but if it makes him happy, why not go fishing?
				AboutSeaCreatures: I don't hunt small fish unless they cause problems for people. My prey are creatures from the depths of the waters. Surprisingly, {0} is not scared when I pull dead creatures out of the water...
				AboutOcean: "{0} He said that being near the ocean is very pleasant.. I must agree. This breeze and sand allow you to have a good rest!"
				AboutFishing: Sometimes it's still nice to just sit in silence and go fishing.... It's not related to my job, but do I have to do nothing but hunt big animals?
			}

			WitchDoctor: {
				AboutWildBeasts: Jungles can surprise... Have you seen these huge hornets? Or live plants? What the {0} knows about them is worth its weight in gold.
				AboutPoisons: It is extremely easy to get hurt in the jungle, and most often these wounds will be with poison.. If it wasn't for {0} antidotes, I would have definitely died... A hundred times.
				AboutJungles: If you need to get somewhere in jungles... Go to the {0} and ask him for the antidote. Preferably for every type of poison.
			}

			DyeTrader: {
				AboutDyes: Sometimes, while hunting or just walking, I see unusual plants. As it turned out, many of them are used to create dyes. If you see any, ask {0} how to make dyes from them!
				FutureLine: "4"
			}
		}

		Census.SpawnCondition: No conditions for spawn
	}
}

